00:36:31.800 --> 00:36:34.514
Like I would love for you guys to continue this project.

797
00:36:34.514 --> 00:36:39.160
Yeah, well, I'll talk about the QAnon piece of it first.

798
00:36:39.160 --> 00:36:40.660
I mean, what drew me to QAnon.

799
00:36:40.660 --> 00:36:44.910
I started off in journalism as a religion reporter.

800
00:36:44.910 --> 00:36:49.910
I spent a semester undercover at Liberty University,

801
00:36:50.510 --> 00:36:54.320
Jerry Falwell's super right-wing Christian university.

802
00:36:54.320 --> 00:36:56.472
And I came from, like, a very secular home,

803
00:36:56.472 --> 00:36:59.010
very liberal, secular,

804
00:36:59.010 --> 00:37:01.650
and so I was just, like, fascinated

805
00:37:01.650 --> 00:37:03.930
by the existence of these like right-wing evangelicals.

806
00:37:03.930 --> 00:37:05.581
So I went there for a semester,

807
00:37:05.581 --> 00:37:08.590
took all the classes, sang in their church choir,

808
00:37:08.590 --> 00:37:09.520
lived in the dorms.

809
00:37:09.520 --> 00:37:10.780
I wrote a book about that,

810
00:37:10.780 --> 00:37:12.950
