1976
01:30:15.130 --> 01:30:19.700
like the attention graph is such a radically elastic thing,

1977
01:30:19.700 --> 01:30:20.533
like it used to be.

1978
01:30:20.533 --> 01:30:21.760
It's weird as hell, man.

1979
01:30:21.760 --> 01:30:22.593
You wrote about this the other day,

1980
01:30:22.593 --> 01:30:23.840
like, you used to just,

1981
01:30:23.840 --> 01:30:26.108
if you could just get on, like, the morning talk show,

1982
01:30:26.108 --> 01:30:28.400
on the "Today" show, or "Good Morning America,"

1983
01:30:28.400 --> 01:30:31.170
and then maybe you get a nice review

1984
01:30:31.170 --> 01:30:32.060
in "The New York Times,"

1985
01:30:32.060 --> 01:30:35.350
